WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:04.000
[Soft ambient music]
A thought. Worth keeping.

00:04.750 --> 00:10.000
Meet AURA.
A place for your ideas.

00:10.450 --> 00:16.000
Press once. Stay present.
Visible recording. Tactile feedback.

00:16.500 --> 00:22.000
Your attention. Your control.
A physical mic disconnect. You decide when to capture.

00:22.500 --> 00:29.000
Keep the moment. Find the meaning.
Capture offline. Organize with your phone.

00:24.700 --> 00:28.900
Illustrative phone note: A quieter morning.
Make space for a walk. Next step: set aside twenty minutes.

00:30.500 --> 00:36.000
AURA. Be here. Keep the thought.
A wearable note-taking concept.

00:32.800 --> 00:36.000
Development concept.
Features subject to engineering validation.
